#. L_DISH_062
msgid ""
"Select the IR Scanner.\n"
"- Hold A Button.\n"
"- Use Control Stick to change selection.\n"
"- Highlight IR Scanner and release A Button.\n"
msgstr ""
"Choisir le Scanner IR.\n"
